package com.nexuszero.mt.core;public final class EncodingLab{private EncodingLab(){}public static String triage(String s){StringBuilder o=new StringBuilder("NEXUS ENCODING LAB\n");for(String t:s.split("[^A-Za-z0-9+/=_-]+")){if(t.length()<16)continue;if(t.matches("[0-9A-Fa-f]+")&&t.length()%2==0)o.append("HEX? ");else if(t.matches("[A-Za-z0-9+/]+={0,2}")&&t.length()%4==0)o.append("BASE64? ");else continue;o.append(t.substring(0,Math.min(100,t.length()))).append('\n');}return o.toString();}}